  unitName: Azure Princess Mariela
  unitId: 20886
  unitNumber: 1448
  description: The princess of a local kingdom under the jurisdiction of the Randall
    Empire. Mariela is said to have been aware of other worlds from an early age,
    as she was blessed with the power to interpret visions reflected on the water's
    surface. Unfortunately, a lion demon came to covet her and her rare gift, eventually
    carrying her off to Ishgria after her father and the Summoners of Old aiding
    him failed to protect her. Once there she was rescued by another demon, who then
    took her as his wife. Curiously, very few people in Elgaia know about this particular
    incident.
  summonDesc: Is this...summoning?<br>I wonder if [[Karl (character)|my boy]] made
    it safely into the hands of the Summoners of Old...
  fusionDesc: Is this...fusion?<br>What a convenient technique.<br>I'd love to teach
    it to Father.
